out our  entire civilization operational  just in case if i were them i would make  sure that every single one of these  things  including the divine beasts are  dismantled and dumped out at sea  somewhere  and again purely from a gameplay  perspective it totally makes sense for  most chica-related tech to be gone  with the exception of maybe the towers  but the shrines would just be a waste of  space  since we already cleared them so what's  the point of keeping them around  another thing that comes to mind is that  zelda games usually see you starting  from the bottom again  now i don't know how they will pull this  off in terms of link's hearts and master  sword but i'm sure they'll find a clever  way around it but  what about the master cycle zero if we  keep that around we might as well just  throw the horses and stables out the  window  unless of course they suddenly start  dealing in motorcycles too  clearly nintendo could just take all  this stuff away without explanation but  weaving it into the story and giving a  proper reason as to why it's gone would  obviously be the better  choice especially since other story  elements like link already having the  master sword  do seem to carry over and that is all  for now  as always thank you for watching the  video views haven't exactly been the  best lately so  if you will spread the video around a  little bit and if you haven't subscribed  yet make sure to hit that notification  bell so you don't miss out on any future  uploads  i normally don't ask for these kinds of  things but yeah it's been kinda rough  lately  i also encourage you to share your  thoughts in the comments below do you  want to see the chica tech return in  breath to wall 2  or not or maybe only a select part of it  a special shout out goes to my amazing  patreons and my channel members who make  these videos possible  some of which have recently joined the  cause so say hello to  ast tattoo cat germ flash k  austin human center rhys richardson  adanor  merlin kuretz as well as a special  mention to nathaniel bogo and julian  clement for upgrading their pledge  you are all amazing and i cannot thank  you enough  i mean really i can't anyway i will see  you all in the next video this is dawn  signing off  and have a good one  [Music]


